  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can sense the stress points on weapons and construction from the ki lowing through the environment.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Str 13, Wis 13, Power Attack, Improved Sunder.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> To use this feat, you must expend your ki focus. When strike at an opponent’s weapon, you ignore two points of the weapon’s Hardness (round down) for every ki point expended. The effects of this ability also apply to any magical enhancements possessed by the weapon that increase its hardness.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can sense the stress points in any hard construction, such as wooden doors or stone walls, and can ignore half of the total Hardness (round down) when attacking that object.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
